== (i) minimal genuinely chiral 4d U(1) spectra ==
  size 3, |q| <= 9: 0 genuinely chiral solutions
  size 4, |q| <= 9: 0 genuinely chiral solutions
  size 5, |q| <= 9: 2 genuinely chiral solutions   first: [-9, -5, -1, 7, 8]
  size 6, |q| <= 9: 4;  smallest by max charge: [-5, -1, -1, -1, 4, 4]
  -> the 4d filter is far more selective than the 2d one: the
     cubic constraint kills everything below size 5.

== (ii) the Standard Model passes the record filter ==
  one generation, all-left Weyl, 6Y units:
   Q: 6x(+1), u^c: 3x(-4), d^c: 3x(+2), L: 2x(-3), e^c: 1x(+6)
   sum q   = 0        sum q^3 = 0
   (15 Weyl fields; nu^c at q = 0 is filter-neutral)
  -> BOTH sums vanish exactly: the hypercharge miracle is a
     record-filter receipt, generation by generation; with three
     generations the sums scale by 3 and still vanish (the
     factorization theorem of p17a in the 4d setting).

== (iii) the SM code is the Z_6 quotient ==
   Q   : 2t + 3d + Y6 =  +6 = 0 mod 6
   u^c : 2t + 3d + Y6 =  -6 = 0 mod 6
   d^c : 2t + 3d + Y6 =  +0 = 0 mod 6
   L   : 2t + 3d + Y6 =  +0 = 0 mod 6
   e^c : 2t + 3d + Y6 =  +6 = 0 mod 6
  all fields pass: True
  -> every SM Weyl field is invariant under the Z_6 subgroup
     generated by (color triality, weak duality, hypercharge
     phase): the faithful gauge code is SU(3)xSU(2)xU(1) / Z_6,
     and in record terms the relation-code CHARACTER LATTICE is
     the quotient lattice - the object the (M) search must
     target, not the naive product.

== (iv) color-triplet shadows in the minimal solutions ==
  size-6 solutions with a charge of multiplicity >= 3: 2/4
    [-5, -1, -1, -1, 4, 4]
    [-4, -4, 1, 1, 1, 5]
  -> a fraction of the minimal chiral spectra already carry the
     multiplicity-3 (color-shadow) structure; combined with
     p17a's closure census (Z_3 universal at minimal scope) the
     Phase-II target is named: NONABELIAN lift of the
     multiplicity-3 charges to triality-code representations -
     blocked on D10 (nonabelian record statistics), as expected.
== p17b done ==
